ntext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rakath_Glitterbeard\" title=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/25px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/38px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/50px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rakath's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/25px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rakath_Glitterbeard\" title=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\">Rakath's</a> office on the top floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Counting House\">Counting House</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-93&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-181</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this book awards 75 experience and progresses the quests <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aid_the_Underduke\" title=\"Aid the Underduke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aid the Underduke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Aid_the_Underduke\" title=\"Aid the Underduke\">Aid the Underduke</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Harper\" title=\"The High Harper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The High Harper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Harper\" title=\"The High Harper\">The High Harper</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A compendium of <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">dwarf</a> history, recording the shifting fortunes of clans and kingdoms over centuries. There are pages of dates, noting important battles, births, and deaths. One in particular, 1356, is circled with a note scribbled beneath.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><b>1356</b>\n</p><p>In this year, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bruenor_Battlehammer\">Bruenor Battlehammer</a> did face the shadow dragon <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shimmergloom\">Shimmergloom</a>, slaying the beast and claiming his rightful place as the Eighth King of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mithral_Hall\">Mithral Hall</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><i>Important: Don't forget to change the code in a tenday!</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200259\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2020/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33256/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10602/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931392/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.893      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.893      1 -total\n 51.91%   24.343      9 Template:Icon_text\n 45.22%   21.205     21 Template:Trim\n 20.52%    9.625      2 Template:Uid\n 18.21%    8.541      4 Template:Icon_link\n 13.42%    6.293      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.94%    5.598      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.71%    5.489      9 Template:Ifempty\n  9.92%    4.652      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12681-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200259 and revision id 394532. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}